---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/legal.css';
---

<Base
  room="paper"
  title="Refunds — Latent"
  description="30-day money-back on website purchases. Write to billing@latentstudios.art and we refund it."
>
  <div class="home">
  <Nav />
  <main class="legal" id="main">
    <div class="legal-label">Refunds</div>
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated 22 October 2026</p>

    <p class="legal-lead">If a purchase from this website is not what you needed, we will refund it.</p>

    <p>You have 30 days from the date of purchase. No questions asked. Write to us at <a href="mailto:billing@latentstudios.art">billing@latentstudios.art</a>, or use the link in your receipt, and you will receive a full refund.</p>

    <p>Purchases are made through a secure checkout by Stripe and sold through Link, Stripe&rsquo;s payment service. We handle every refund ourselves, and the refund includes any tax you paid.</p>

    <p>The refund goes back to your original payment method, usually within 5 to 10 business days of approving the request. Purchases made earlier through Paddle are refunded the same way: write to us.</p>

    <p>This policy applies to purchases made through latentstudios.art and Latent Manager, including The Lab&rsquo;s DaVinci Resolve Studio plugin and the independent Mac edition of Latent The Ritual. App Store purchases follow Apple&rsquo;s refund process, not this page.</p>

    <p>If something is wrong with the software itself, write to us anyway. We would rather fix it or refund it than leave you stuck.</p>

    <a class="legal-back" href="/">← Back to Latent</a>
  </main>
  <Footer />
  </div>

</Base>
